{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Praxis with a quartic base, relative binomial and scalar ring with coefficient-first cancellation",
  "claims": [
    "params.json is a parameter set of Praxis for the reference statement at 100-bit security whose ciphertext is 6715 MiB (6.5569 GiB) and whose time, one encryption plus one expected decryption, is 2841229 million field multiplications (20761 and 2820469), by the protected model, and every rule of the model as amended holds for it; proof.md proves that each amended entry (I3, Ncmp, I6, I4, n2, dec_msm_g1, dec_msm_g2, dec_pairings, n1, C6, C7, dec_sum_g2, H2) is sound, so that the paper's theorems hold for these parameters as rules.md requires."
  ],
  "experiments": [],
